    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-21" id="fn-21" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">(1) Various points of interconnect in the integrated system</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-22" id="fn-22" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">The expenses incurred are for transmission of electricity and supporting services provided by the Midcontinent Independent System Operator and the Southwest Power Pool.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-23" id="fn-23" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">The expenses incurred are for facility service agreement fees.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-24" id="fn-24" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">The peak numbers for April through June are estimated and are from MISO's S-55,&#160; S-14, or S-7 settlement data.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-25" id="fn-25" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">The peak numbers for April through June are estimated and are from MISO's S-55,&#160; S-14, or S-7 settlement data.</link:footnote>
